---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Nexus Apps — Nexus Wave Technologies">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Nexus products</p><h1>Apps built around real everyday needs.</h1><p class="lead">Explore Nexus Plus and Geeta Nexus, with clear sections for features, accessibility and membership information.</p></div></section>
  <section id="nexus-plus" class="section"><div class="container grid-2">
    <div class="card"><img src="/assets/nexus-plus-mockup.jpg" alt="Nexus Plus app preview" style="width:100%;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:1rem" /><p class="eyebrow">Nexus Plus</p><h2>One place for AI, media and accessibility tools.</h2><p class="muted">AI assistant, audio editing, PDF utilities, e-paper workflows, media tools and accessibility-focused features.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://play.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open app listing</a><a class="button" href="/contact">Contact</a></div></div>
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Business & pricing</p><h2>Free services with optional paid AI tools.</h2>
<ul class="feature-list"><li><strong>Free:</strong> Women Safety Center and public support-information features.</li><li><strong>Free:</strong> Community, Posts, migration/help information and basic website utilities.</li><li><strong>Free:</strong> Core non-AI Nexus services and accessibility-oriented tools.</li><li><strong>Paid:</strong> Selected AI features, premium AI tools, AI credits and other clearly labelled premium capabilities inside Nexus Plus.</li></ul>
<div class="grid-3"><div class="stat"><strong>AI</strong><span class="muted">Paid where labelled premium</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Safety</strong><span class="muted">Free</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Core</strong><span class="muted">Free</span></div></div>
<p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem">Prices, taxes, billing periods and refund eligibility are shown before a paid purchase. Payment processing may be handled by an external provider such as PayU.</p>
<a class="button" href="/legal/refund">Read Refund Policy</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section id="geeta-nexus" class="section surface-soft"><div class="container grid-2">
    <div class="card"><img src="/assets/geeta-nexus-mockup.jpg" alt="Geeta Nexus app preview" style="width:100%;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:1rem" /><p class="eyebrow">Geeta Nexus</p><h2>Accessible spiritual learning.</h2><p class="muted">Explore Bhagavad Gita content with an emphasis on clear reading, Hindi and English support, and accessible navigation.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Use it on the web too</h3><p class="muted">Read Bhagavad Gita shlok directly on the website before deciding whether you need the full app experience.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/shlok">Open Shlok Reader</a><a class="button" href="/shlok">Today's Shlok</a></div><p class="note">Geeta Nexus also contains broader scripture experiences such as Shiva Mahapurana and Ramcharitmanas.</p></div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>